        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Finance reviews project margin: material cost vs. project price; ensures minimum margin threshold met; approves or requests pricing adjustment; quotation valid for 30 days
Responsible (R): Finance
Accountable (A): Project Consultant
Duration: 1–2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2434_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
